      "name": "ShutdownDirectSound",
      "signature": "void ShutdownDirectSound(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Shuts down DirectSound and releases all audio resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear sound interface pointer and set volume to 0\n2. Shutdown audio game object and cleanup sound thread event\n3. Release each DirectSound COM interface (Primary, Secondary, Buffer, 3DListener, GameState) via Release()\n4. Delete critical section if initialized\n\nParameters:\n- None (uses global state)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeDirectSound: Initialization counterpart\n- SetSoundVolume, ShutdownAudioGameObject, CleanupSoundThreadEvent: Called helpers",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
