      "name": "ReleaseSoundObjects",
      "signature": "void ReleaseSoundObjects(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Releases three DirectSound COM objects by calling virtual destructor (offset 0x8), then zeroes global pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each of three sound object globals (pDSoundPrimary, pDSoundSecondary, pDSoundBuffer):\n   - Check if pointer is non-NULL\n   - Call virtual destructor at offset 0x8 (IUnknown::Release)\n   - Zero the global pointer\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeDirectSound: Acquires these objects\n- DirectSoundCreate: Creates primary DirectSound object",
