      "name": "InitializeSlotArray",
      "signature": "void InitializeSlotArray(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize game slot array with callback results.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if already initialized via g_dwInitialized flag\n2. If initialized, return early\n3. Acquire mutex (g_hSlotMutex) via EnterCriticalSection\n4. Iterate through 4 slots in g_adSlotData array\n5. For each slot, call Ordinal_10027 with slot index and populate result\n6. Release mutex via LeaveCriticalSection\n7. Set initialization flag to 1\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: g_dwInitialized = initialization flag (0=not done, 1=initialized)\n- IMPLICIT: g_adSlotData = array of 4 slot data entries (uint array)\n- IMPLICIT: g_hSlotMutex = critical section handle for synchronization\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4: Number of slots in array\n- 0xff: Parameter passed to Ordinal_10027",
