      "name": "UNITS_SetUnitHighlight",
      "signature": "void UNITS_SetUnitHighlight(void * pUnit, dword dwColor)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets unit highlight color. Validates unit pointer and assigns color value to offset 0x40 in unit structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Test if pUnit is NULL (ECX == 0)\n2. If NULL, trigger assertion and exit with error code 0xFFFFFFFF\n3. Store dwColor at offset 0x40 in unit structure\n4. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (void*): Pointer to unit structure to highlight\n- dwColor (dword): Color value to set (stored at unit offset 0x40)\n\nReturns:\n- void (or error code 0xFFFFFFFF on NULL pointer)",
