      "name": "ActivateSoundSlot",
      "signature": "int ActivateSoundSlot(dword * piSlot)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Activates a sound slot by marking it as ready for playback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer (abort if NULL)\n2. Acquire critical section lock for thread safety\n3. Call virtual function at offset 0x30 within structure (likely initializes playback)\n4. Return failure if initialization returns negative (error code)\n5. Set slot[7] to 1 to mark as active/ready\n6. Release critical section lock\n7. Return success\n\nParameters:\n- piSlot (dword*): Pointer to sound slot structure; must not be NULL\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (slot activated)\n- 0 on failure (initialization error)",
