      "comment": "Returns element at index 7 of sound buffer data structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pointer is non-null\n2. Validate dereferenced value is non-null\n3. Return array element at offset 7\n4. Assert if validation fails\n\nParameters:\n- pData (int*): Pointer to sound buffer data structure\n\nReturns:\n- Value at pData[7] (sound buffer property)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 7: Array index for sound buffer field access",
