      "name": "DisplayRuntimeError",
      "signature": "void DisplayRuntimeError(uint dwMessageType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Formats and displays runtime error or status messages to console or message box.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Search message type table (DAT_6f9f0d88) for matching message ID\n2. If found and in initialization/termination state, write message to stdout\n3. Otherwise format detailed error dialog with program path, error type, and error ID\n4. Display formatted error via message box with Microsoft Visual C++ Runtime Library title\n\nParameters:\n- nMessageType (uint): Message/error ID to display\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Uses static message table at 0x6f9f0d88 for message lookup\n- Truncates file path at 60 chars if too long\n- Handles both console output and GUI message boxes",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
