      "name": "InitializeCodePageLocale",
      "signature": "uint InitializeCodePageLocale(uint dwCodePage)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Initializes character classification table for a given code page.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Acquire mutex (0x19) for thread-safe access\n2. Get the code page ID via FUN_6f9e9cc0\n3. Check if already initialized - if yes, skip table setup\n4. If code page is new:\n   a. Search predefined table or use GetCPInfo\n   b. Clear character class table (64 entries + terminator)\n   c. Mark lead bytes and trail bytes based on code page info\n   d. Store locale-specific data (multibyte max size, class info)\n5. Call locale-specific functions to finalize setup\n6. Release mutex and return result\n\nParameters:\n- dwCodePage (uint): Code page identifier (e.g., 932 for Shift-JIS)\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- 0xFFFFFFFF on failure (GetCPInfo failed and no fallback available)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
